/Subtype /FreeText
/DA (//Helvetica 12 Tf 0 g)
/Border [0 0 0]
/Type /Annot
/Rect [61.59089 396.4349 548.0566 729.9349]
/M (D:20250327020616Z00'00')
/AP <<
/N 997 0 R
>>
/Contents (This study is evident that magnets are an effective means to manage joint pain. With the difference being greater in the active magnet group than the placebo, it adds to that claim. The study provided good statistics but to be an even more trustworthy study there should have been more quantitative results rather than qualitative, as in the participants ranking their pain verbally. With the study relying vastly on qualitative results it limits the study but it is good regardless.)
/T (Mobile User)
>>
